umMaster/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"A long first line pasted into an asynchronous question could submit before the rest of the paste arrived. Restore main #2405 / D642(c)'s 32 ms Enter lookahead, preserving immediate raw or bracketed continuation as a newline.\n\nA unique-token timer materializes the draft and re-enters `ChatWidget::handle_question_key`; redraw ticks never dispatch an answer. Navigation, collapse, resolution, draft restoration, modal entry, and app-level overlays/disconnect/input-owner transitions cancel pending state. Existing queue, permission, typing and delivery guards remain on the answer path. This follows the owner's key-path requirement, superseding #2433's original tick-dispatch proposal.\n\nValidation at **5dcf0f9abd0219f491a2c0eeb137981b4a648736**:\n- Rust 1.99.1: **116/116 focused tests pass on both macOS and Linux**, including ChatWidget wrong-question, single-delivery, continuation and stale-event regressions. App tests cover an overlay/disconnect that ends before timer delivery. No tests removed or disabled.\n- Mac `just fix -p codex-tui -j8` and changed-file formatting pass. Linux build used `-j10`; isolated profiles and keyring denial were retained on both hosts.\n- Independent read-only Opus 5.5 High **APPROVE**, round **2/2**, on this exact head; normal verdict comment because no security-owned paths changed. Non-blocking timing follow-ups preserved on #2407.\n- **All 13 CI checks completed:** 4 passed, 6 skipped, 3 failed from unchanged SYNC-base CLI syntax (#2274). [repo-checks](https://github.com/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/actions/runs/43927813170/job/133511857448) hits unresolved markers in `logs_client.rs`, `debug_sandbox.rs`, `doctor.rs` and `doctor/git.rs`; [packaging](https://github.com/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/actions/runs/43927796544/job/133511795202) fails at `debug_sandbox.rs:450`; [CI required](https://github.com/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/actions/runs/43927813170/job/133513958770) aggregates repo-checks. Logs inspected individually. CLI subtree is identical in SYNC base and this head (`a258529d1f7c8dcbbee4a9e261580ee194b06665`). No pending checks.\n\nReferences #2433, #2405, #1532 and #2312. No production/test overlap with astra-syncapp #2435. Bounded Product principles fix: “Maintain continuous Codex parity without removing Corbanu-specific behavior.” Compile-pass/PF-85 evidence only; no SG2/SG3 or release qualification claim.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-16T18:04:53Z","updated_at":"2026-11-16T18:34:56Z","closed_at":"2026-11-16T18:34:56Z","merged_at":"2026-11-16T18:34:56Z","merge_commit_sha":"ea6e90318eef0cc8fed77a7b2f961f971f36747a","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"CorbanuCore:fix/astra-syncfu-paste","ref":"fix/astra-syncfu-paste","repo":{"id":1283517261,"node_id":"R_kgDOTIDrTQ","name":"CorbanuTerminal","full_name":"CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal","owner":{"login":"CorbanuCore","id":315989408,"node_id":"O_kgDOEtWdoA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/315989408?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore","html_url":"https://github.com/CorbanuCore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false